---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

// FXR-45: erreichbar nur nach einem Warteliste-Absenden — kein Grund, dass sie in der
// Suche auftaucht. `Base` bekommt hier keine neue Prop (nicht anfassen); die Seite trägt
// ihr eigenes Robots-Meta.
const guidePath = '/downloads/fixedr-guide.pdf'; // Platzhalter-Pfad, PDF selbst folgt später
---
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
<Base
  title="Thanks"
  description="You're on the FixedR waitlist. Your guide is one tap away."
  narrow
>
  <h1>You're on the list</h1>
  <p>
    Check your inbox — we've sent the same link below to your email address, so you have it
    either way.
  </p>
  <p>
    <a class="btn" href={guidePath}>Get your guide</a>
  </p>
  <p style="color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem;">
    Eight short chapters, about 20 minutes: the problems that end a challenge more often than the
    strategy does, and what closes each one structurally. A few short follow-up emails come next,
    ending with an invitation once the next window opens.
  </p>
  <hr />
  <p style="color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem;">
    Wrong inbox, or want off the list? Details in the <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>.
  </p>
</Base>
